      "releaseNotes": "FilmFold 2.0 is rebuilt from the ground up as a native app: faster, and closer to real film.\n\n• Recipes: set the white balance on the new temperature pad, save your setup and share it as a link or QR code\n• A new camera showcase for switching bodies, lenses and accessories\n• Edit after the shot: change the camera, frame and lens, or go back to how the photo was taken\n• Focal, reimagined: motion blur that fans out from your subject, with fine film grain\n• More natural grain, a truer Cold Flash and a refined ECN Push +1\n• New story layouts: Recipe, Signature, Light, Detail and Enlargement\n• Landscape videos keep their shape in your library",
