      "currency": "USD",
      "description": "Turn your iPhone into 22 original film, CCD, VHS and Super 8 cameras for photos and video. Every camera has its own optics, controls, aspect ratio and development — not just a filter applied afterward.\n\nCAMERA BODIES, NOT FILTERS\nChoose from 35mm film, medium format, instant, CCD point-and-shoot, VHS and Super 8 bodies. Each one changes how you frame, shoot and develop.\n\nSHOOT PHOTO OR VIDEO\nCapture stills or record with VHS, Tape 99, Warm 8 and Cine 35. FilmFold develops video on-device, frame by frame, with tape wobble, chroma bleed, flicker, gate weave and grain baked into the file.\n\nBUILD YOUR OWN SETUP\nMount interchangeable lenses and accessories for optical distortion, chromatic aberration, diffusion, period-correct flash and pushed film.\n\nKEEP THE ORIGINAL\nEvery capture keeps its untouched original. Re-develop it with another camera, lens or adjustment as many times as you want without degrading the source.\n\nDOUBLE EXPOSURE\nLayer two frames together like film, rather than applying a flat blend afterward.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nNo account. No ads. No media cloud. Photo and video processing stays on your iPhone, and your media only leaves the device when you choose to share it.\n\nFILMFOLD PRO\nDownload FilmFold for free. FilmFold Pro unlocks the full camera collection with either an auto-renewable annual subscription, including a 7-day free trial, or a one-time Lifetime purchase.\n\nPayment is charged to your Apple Account at confirmation. The annual subscription renews automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel it in Settings › Apple Account › Subscriptions.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://filmfold.app/privacy",
      "minimumOsVersion": "17.0",
      "languageCodesISO2A": [
        "EN",
